{
 "about": "PIP declarations in forms real configurations use and no golden sends, with synthetic names: no pipType, and the older shapes that carry only a url and some of requestAttributes, jsonPath, headers, httpMethod, type, or a beanName and no url; a url placeholder that names neither the subject nor the resource; ${operation} in requestAttributes. Each case reads the PIP in `<PIP> == 'v' OR resource.a == 'y'`, and pipCalls records the call: route r32gaps-corpus answers v. Read as GENERAL, an upload is 200 and a = n true; an upload is 400 if a PIP needs a pipType, and both requests are false if the PIP fails when read.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R32G_",
